{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Maria Watches Over Us 3rd Season OVA","Summer has arrived at last, and with it comes the promise of summer break for the students of Lillian Girls’ Academy. Sachiko and Yumi retreat to the summer home of the Ogasawara family for a season of rest and relaxation, but their rosy trip soon sours when some old friends of Sachiko’s unexpectedly drop in. These wealthy snobs turn up their noses at Yumi and Sachiko’s relationship — and if Yumi isn’t careful, her blissful summer at Sachiko’s side could come to an abrupt and tearful end.\n\n\n\n(Source: Maiden Japan)"],"ja":["マリア様がみてる～3rdシーズンOVA～",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":444,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":3750,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-1729","ids":{"shikimori":1729,"mal":1729,"anilist":1729,"kodik":"serial-24488"},"kodikIds":["serial-69571","serial-24488"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-69571":"2025-09-20T15:41:37Z","serial-24488":"2020-04-06T13:26:26Z"},"title":"Дева Мария смотрит за вами 3","originalTitle":"Maria-sama ga Miteru 3rd Season","alt":"Maria Watches Over Us 3rd Season OVA Maria Watches Over Us 3rd Season OVA マリア様がみてる～3rdシーズンOVA～","description":"Наступает лето, а вместе с ним в Женскую Академию Лилианы приходят и каникулы! Юми и Сатико отправляются в летний дом семьи Огасавара, но спокойный сначала отдых становится далеко не спокойным, когда старые друзья Сатико приходят к ней в гости. Эти богатые и снобистские девушки полагают, что Юми не достойна любви Сатико, и собираются сделать это лето для Юми настоящим кошмаром...","year":2006,"type":"OVA","genres":["седзе","Драма","седзе ай","юри","Школа"],"rating":7.81,"popularity":5214,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[444,3750],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx1729-DQG9C83HbBX6.jpg","width":460,"height":690},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n1729-54txIddXFjoc.jpg","width":1900,"height":550}},"releasedEpisode